{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Do not interpretations belong to Elohim?</b> The future events that come in dreams — they belong to Elohim, for He alone decrees and makes known what will be, and He makes peace and creates evil; and there is in my words neither benefit nor loss for you. Therefore tell it to me now — perhaps HaShem will be willing to reveal it to me."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:19:02.144914067Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}